WEBVTT

00:00:03.748 --> 00:00:09.570
Sign in, with the list read held 3 s at the local stand-in: the loader's lift-and-return, then the list.

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:14.009
The list: the count, one Import action, the subscriptions; the account and Sign out are at the end.

00:00:14.009 --> 00:00:23.134
More options: the menu grows from its button; Back closes it, fading after.

00:00:23.134 --> 00:00:25.607
Explore services, chosen from the menu: the screen opens at once; the menu fades after.

00:00:25.607 --> 00:00:29.481
Back to the list.

00:00:29.481 --> 00:00:31.769
A subscription: pressed ground, then it slides in.

00:00:31.769 --> 00:00:33.157
Back: it slides away.
